From a069ac58415e5f956030dbff29c1b8b7cb131fd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:31:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] spec_lanes: rules for up to four lanes and the shared
 arenas (opt-in STRATA_SPEC_LANES=2..4)

env_lanes takes 2, 3 and 4 (Lmax); gate_start (n_min .. L lane slots) and gate_keep (KEEP: one lane slot
is enough; off: M1b's gate); hold / env_hold (STRATA_SPEC_LANES_HOLD=k, 1 = M1b's two); own_arenas,
snaps_in_lane, lanes_cost, room_ok and fit_lanes (the boot's lane count: every card keeps the floor after
the lazy allocations).  solo_pipeline::env_on_with_lanes: STRATA_SPEC_LANES folds the solo pipeline in
unless STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE says otherwise.  CPU tests for all of it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
